  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a la Reforma de Salud</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Reform Support Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE OF THE PROGRAM IS TO SUPPORT THE REFORM ON THE HEALTH SECTOR. THE BASE OF THIS REFORM IS THE NEW LEGISLATION APPROVED BY THE CONGRESS IN 1993 TO GUARANTEE AN EQUAL COVERAGE OF HEALTH SERVICES TO THE POPULATION. AT THE SAME TIME ACHIEVE MORE EFFICIENCY IN THE WAY THAT THESE SERVICES ARE PROVIDED AND THE USE OF THE SOURCES ASIGNED TO THE HEALTH SECTOR. THE GOAL OF THE REFORM IS TO IMPROVE THE HEALTH CARE SYSTEM AND EXTEND ITS COVERAGE</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
